                                "sense_id": "39d83f7a-482a-3207-9f8e-375673db64b5",
                                "text": "I should conjecture […] that the caprification is either an antient process of imaginary use, and blindly followed in some countries, or that it may contribute to ripen the fig by decreasing its vigour […]."
